# SOURCE 2/2: independent OpenAI manual fallback. Edit this file only.
# SOURCE 1/2 (automatic): rules/openai-auto.list (Voice IP + public geosite).
# Only remove an active manual rule if another ACTIVE rule INSIDE THIS FILE
# provably covers all its destinations; never compare against automatic rules.
# The generator adds the configured OpenAI node name; do NOT put it here.
# Coverage-first policy: first-party hosts, LiveKit voice, and officially
# listed shared ChatGPT dependencies are ACTIVE. These may also route traffic
# from other apps using those exact/shared vendor hosts to the OpenAI node.
# Unverified and overbroad third-party patterns remain archived for review.
# HY's geosite:openai comes from the independently updated automatic source.
# HY's broad udp/3478 catch-all remains archived, since it catches other apps.

